    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend section 8 of part CC of chapter 57 of the laws of 2014 relating to the \"Rockland Bergen Flood Mitigation act\" and creating the Rockland Bergen Flood Mitigation Task Force, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S4858",
